			"notes": "### Minecraft CLI Bridge for Codex and Claude (claude-codex-chat) v1.0.0\n\nA 100% client-side Fabric mod for Minecraft 26.1.2 that turns Minecraft into an alternate frontend for Claude Code and OpenAI Codex running locally on your machine.\n\n#### Installation\n1. Install [Fabric Loader](https://fabricmc.net/) for Minecraft 26.1.2.\n2. Place \\claude-codex-chat-1.0.0.jar\\ into your \\.minecraft/mods\\ folder.\n3. Launch Minecraft and press \\U\\ to open the AI Composer.\n\n#### Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.1.2\n- Fabric Loader >= 0.19.3\n- Fabric API >= 0.155.2\n- Java >= 25\n- Claude Code CLI and/or Codex CLI installed locally"
